Attribute modo for SENTENCEVAR added.
\item date: 01/11/88\ \ \ \ \ author: Elly van Munster \\
Attribute "infsort" added.
\item date: 19/04/90\ \ \ \ \ author: Lisette Appelo\\
added subrules 6b, 8 and 9
\end{enumerate}
